      "jobId": "6993ad1b-154f-40c6-918c-81ac1f0fc1be",
      "question": "On the scanned PM-1 round sheet for press DAY-PRS-03 dated 14 September 2026, what oil temperature did the operator record, and what action was raised for the ram seal?",
      "submittedAt": "2026-10-03T04:15:11.505179Z",
      "completedAt": "2026-10-03T04:15:16.541804Z",
      "status": "success",
      "report": {
        "markdown": "Based on the scanned PM-1 round sheet for hydraulic press **DAY-PRS-03** dated **14 September 2026**:\n\n| Item | Recorded Value / Action |\n|------|--------------------------|\n| **Oil temperature** | **63 °C** — marked **NOT OK** with remark “63 C too hot” (limit is 62 °C) [1] |\n| **Ram seal condition** | **NOT OK** — remark “weep at ram seal, drip tray half full” [1] |\n| **Action raised** | **Maintenance Request MR‑2287** — “replace ram seal kit + check pump. Run light duty only until fixed. Told D. Whitfield.” [1] |\n\n## Sources\n\n- [1] Unstructured Retrieval evidence — 2 documents — evidence `hermes-receipt:48ad7887eb3c087ed002b0c3e7ef70c6af036dfc4f948cf194e69410d7d78203`",
