                "snippet": "ATLAS PRECISION COMPONENTS PM-1 OPERATOR ROUND SHEET - HYDRAULIC PRESS Form MNT-F-012 Rev C Keep on machine; file 12 months\nDate 14 Sep 2026, Machine ID DAY-PRS-03 = Shift / Operator 2 T. Brennan. Date 14 Sep 2026,  = \n1, CHECK ITEM = Hydraulic oil level in sight glass (above minimum mark). 1, OK = . 1, NOT OK = . 1, REMARKS / READING = topped up 2 L. 2, CHECK ITEM = Oil temperature at working load (limit 62 C). 2, OK = . 2, NOT OK = X. 2, REMARKS / READING = 63 C too hot. 3, CHECK ITEM = Ram seal and cylinder rod free of leaks. 3, OK = . 3, NOT OK = X. 3, REMARKS / READING = weep at ram seal, drip tray half full. 4, CHECK ITEM = Pump noise and vibration normal. 4, OK = . 4, NOT OK = X. 4, REMARKS / READING = pump white: louder than last wk. 5, CHECK ITEM = Guard interlocks and light curtain test. 5, OK = . 5, NOT OK = . 5, REMARKS / READING = . 6, CHECK ITEM = Two-hand control and E-stop test. 6, OK = . 6, NOT OK = . 6, REMARKS / READING = . 7, CHECK ITEM = Accumulator pre-charge gauge in green band. 7, OK = . 7, NOT OK = . 7, REMARKS / READING = in green. 8, CHECK ITEM = Work area clean, no slip hazards. 8, OK = . 8, NOT OK = . 8, REMARKS / READING = ",
